+/*
+ * Credits text of the game folder (BRA), shown scrolling over a background:
+ * - end titles: loc/titoli.txt says in which location of which part, how many seconds after
+ *   entering it, which text rolls, over which background and inside which box. The roll can be
+ *   skipped (Esc, click) and the game goes on where it was;
+ * - the game menu (Info): the same text in a window the player scrolls (crediti/<language>.txt).
+ * The text is <name>/<language>.txt (fallback it), UTF-8: "# comment", "---" new page, "== title",
+ * "= section", "Role: name", "> note", empty line = space. The engine knows no location, text or
+ * picture of its own. With the HD fonts (hd/fonts) and the remastered look the text uses them,
+ * otherwise the original bitmap fonts, scaled. Formats in docs/formati.md of the remaster project.
+ */
