+/*
+ * In-game hints (key H): hint/<language>.txt in the game folder, a list of objectives per part in play
+ * order; the first one whose "fatto" (done) condition is false is shown, with a button for the
+ * solution. Format in docs/aiuti.md of the remaster project.
+ */
