+/*
+ * The Big Red Adventure: the game's menu instead of ScummVM's global menu. One menu on every
+ * platform (web page, Android, Mac with the native engine), opened by Esc (and Ctrl+F5, and the
+ * star of the page, which sends Esc):
+ *   Riprendi · Carica · Salva · Suggerimenti · Remastered ON/OFF · Impostazioni · Info · Esci
+ * Impostazioni: music, effects and voices volume, how the picture fills the screen, the on-screen
+ * shortcuts of the page, the Dropbox sync of the saves (asked to the host: menu_br.h).
+ * Info: the game manual, the version, the remaster's credits (credits.cpp), ScummVM's credits and licences.
+ * The windows have the rays of the app's loader behind their buttons. Layouts: the "bra" theme
+ * (tools/web/tema_bra.py adds GlobalMenu.Hints/Remaster/Settings/Info, BraSettings, BraInfo with Credits).
